"},{"name":"Moving Target","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40b591eae7f122fdf1cfca21fc6f6c0f.png","desc":"Increased movement speed and target acquisition when moving while aiming down sights."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Moving Target","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40b591eae7f122fdf1cfca21fc6f6c0f.png","desc":"Increased movement speed and target acquisition when moving while aiming down sights."},{"name":"Adrenaline Junkie","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6f8bde03140b53e6dc583ada1aeaa51d.png","desc":"This weapon gains increased damage and handling from final blows with grenades or this weapon."},{"name":"Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/23e06f4ced1b3e6476f342978ff5bb37.png","desc":"Being in combat for an extended time increases damage, handling, and reload for this weapon until you are out of combat."},{"name":"Osmosis","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/22ca6e872824561b12e91517e1bde608.png","desc":"Using your grenade ability partially refills the magazine and changes this weapon's damage type to match your grenade until you stow it."},{"name":"Eye of the Storm","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f4755f9068959b26b8829641e5725ad.png","desc":"This weapon becomes more accurate and boosts handling as your health gets lower."},{"name":"Snapshot Sights","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ce16c9e2cbd73bb548af3e15bdfc7177.png","desc":"Faster time to aim down sights."},{"name":"Wellspring","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ec2e3096ebd447bd6137735c9067b991.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon generate ability energy. This energy is divided between your uncharged abilities."},{"name":"Multikill Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3749921a74a378259228d5e989459311.png","desc":"Reloading grants increased damage based on the number of rapid final blows made beforehand."},{"name":"Thresh","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7f9dcf3bd4a8a4e0d2d0922827f038c9.png","desc":"Killing combatants with this weapon generates a small amount of Super energy."},{"name":"One for All","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b1bce269c3cd21393131b4f5cffae692.png","desc":"Hitting three separate targets increases damage for a moderate duration."},{"name":"High-Impact Reserves","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/33ed859a08f2ccf643a1ac3c7f201966.png","desc":"Rounds at the end of the magazine deal more damage."},{"name":"Kill Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0afd4799427004b2d8170ab213a2ef0c.png","desc":"Reloading after a kill grants increased damage."},{"name":"Precision Instrument","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e6a4ebc1a8a73e4c7fcfc21c69000ce2.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage increases precision damage."},{"name":"Adagio","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b344c34bf750a840b24ff5d2f8fe4507.png","desc":"After defeating a target, this weapon fires, charges, or draws more slowly and deals increased damage for a brief time."},{"name":"Explosive Payload","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/31f02e5f3bae68ecdfdd3f899cf931c7.png","desc":"Projectiles create an area-of-effect detonation on impact."},{"name":"Rangefinder","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/74270d52bec24f1f5f4c987f5f37fce9.png","desc":"Aiming this weapon increases its effective range and zoom magnification. Increased projectile velocity while aiming Rocket Launchers, Grenade Launchers, and Bows."}]},{"label":"Origin Trait","weight":0.5,"perks":[{"name":"One Quiet Moment","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/5dee055d9ec357e47521bcf18e8d9b0f.png","desc":"Grants increased reload speed and handling when out of combat. Swords gain faster movement speed."},{"name":"Accelerated Assault","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0fe2a63b375af0d8b17ccee5ad65415b.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage with this weapon loads a small amount of ammo from reserves, or removes heat, and slightly increases damage."},{"name":"Roar of Battle","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e2157adc16129c403e63024ff475482b.png","desc":"Being in combat for a short duration increases handling and stability."},{"name":"Tex Balanced Stock","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/fda0d944e47165312dd193665560fadb.png","desc":"Damaging targets while firing from the hip increases handling, reload speed, and movement speed while aiming down sights."}]}],"notes":["[YeezyGT's S16] [MW: Range] \"There's a fair few playstyles you can get out of Survivor's Epitaph. Aim for max Range where you can, and either buff yourself like crazy with combinations of Rapid Hit/Heating Up/Tunnel Vision, pairing with (Multi)/Kill Clip, or ground yourself with strong passive choices - Slideshot for extra range, aiming for flinch pressure, Rapid Hit/Eye of the Storm or Moving Target... There's a long list of ways you can get the gun to work for you, if you can manage to slim down its absolutely massive perk pool.\" tags:pvp","Inspired by Destiny Massive Breakdowns Podcast 213. PvP first choice roll. Recommended MW: Stability.","Inspired by Destiny Massive Breakdowns Podcast 213. PvP backup roll. Recommended MW: Stability.","Inspired by Destiny Massive Breakdowns Podcast 213. PvP/PvE first choice roll. Recommended MW: Stability.","Inspired by Destiny Massive Breakdowns Podcast 213. PvE first choice roll. Recommended MW: Stability.","File auto generated from csv pandapaxxy-s15-roundup (tags: controller,pve)","Drewsky (PvE): B-Tier (Average). Recommended MW: Range. Recommended Barrel: Any Range Boost.","Drewsky (PvP): B-Tier (Average). Recommended MW: Range. Recommended Barrel: Any Range Boost."],"estimated":null,"modes":{"all":{"rolls":[[2,18,35,46],[2,18,35,50],[6,18,35,46],[6,18,35,50],[8,18,35,46],[8,18,35,50],[2,13,28,41],[2,13,28,46],[2,13,28,50],[2,13,30,41],[2,13,30,46],[2,13,30,50],[2,13,35,41],[2,13,35,46],[2,13,35,50],[2,16,25,39],[2,16,25,43],[2,16,25,46],[2,16,25,50],[2,18,24,39],[2,18,24,43],[2,18,24,46],[2,18,24,50],[2,18,25,39],[2,18,25,43],[2,18,25,46],[2,18,25,50],[2,18,35,39],[2,18,35,43],[6,1